<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">广告模拟配置</view><view class="notice warn section">仅本地模拟，配置立即影响消费者入口。禁止输入真实支付凭据或AI密钥。管理员权限由服务层校验。</view><view class="card section"><view class="row config-row"><text>开启模拟入口</text><switch checked="{{config.enabled}}" data-key="enabled" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="config-row">激励视频广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.rewardedVideo}}" data-key="rewardedVideo"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">首页Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.homeBanner}}" data-key="homeBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">识餐Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.photoBanner}}" data-key="photoBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">健康记录Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.healthBanner}}" data-key="healthBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">我的Banner广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.profileBanner}}" data-key="profileBanner"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">首页插屏广告位ID<input type="text" value="{{config.homeInterstitial}}" data-key="homeInterstitial"  bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">每日完整观看可领取次数<input type="number" value="{{config.dailyLimit}}" data-key="dailyLimit" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="config-row">每次赠送识餐 / AI次数<input type="number" value="{{config.grant}}" data-key="grant" data-number="true" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存生效</button></view><view class="card section"><view class="title"><image class="section-symbol" src="/images/ui/edit.svg"/>完整观看奖励记录</view><view wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id" class="config-row">{{item.date}} · +{{item.grant}}次</view></view></view>